Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Improve Visit Site button implementation: replace inline
 JS with anchor tags

- Replace button with onclick to proper anchor tags for Visit Site links
- Add rel='noopener noreferrer' for security
- Makes URLs more transparent and reliable in the DOM
- Addresses user concern about duplicate contracts showing same URL
  (Note: Some contracts legitimately appear in multiple categories with same URL)

Co-Authored-By: mario@corama.ai <mario@corama.ai>
---
 templates/welcome.html | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/templates/welcome.html b/templates/welcome.html
index bac0d38..05eac49 100644
--- a/templates/welcome.html
+++ b/templates/welcome.html
@@ -659,9 +659,9 @@
                         </button>
                     </div>
                     <div class="contract-cell">
-                        <button class="view-original-btn" onclick="window.open('${contract.detail_link}', '_blank')">
+                        <a href="${contract.detail_link}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="view-original-btn" style="display: inline-block; padding: 8px 16px; text-decoration: none; text-align: center;">
                             Visit Site
-                        </button>
+                        </a>
                     </div>
                 `;
                 
